<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria to offer 1.0 bln levs 4-wk T-bills Friday.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria to offer 1.0 bln levs 4-wk T-bills Friday.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer one billion levs worth of four-week discount T-bills at an auction on Friday, the Bulgarian National Bank said.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow:</p>
<p> Issue number	 BG 3010497009</p>
<p> Auction date	 January 10, 1997</p>
<p> Issue date	   January 16, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date	February 13, 1997</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
</text>
